### base
NarrowBody             refused(rc=1)
    | crashed: error:badarith
NarrowBodyPos          accepted(output)
    | 0
CoverAtom              refused(rc=1)
    | CoverAtom/a.bs:3:13: error: F is not exhaustive
    |   no clause matches:
    |     F(n) -> ...
### grammar
NarrowBody             accepted(output)
    | 0
NarrowBodyPos          accepted(output)
    | 0
CoverAtom              refused(rc=1)
    | CoverAtom/a.bs:3:13: error: F is not exhaustive
    |   no clause matches:
    |   and no pattern spells:
    |     (atom \ (:a))
